# NOT ignored, deliberately:
#   frontend/openapi.json                     — the published contract
#   frontend/packages/api-client/src/schema.d.ts — generated, but committed so CI
#     can regenerate and fail on a diff. That drift check is the whole guarantee
#     that the published spec matches what the server serves.
